{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":87,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":87,"text":"The speedup is correct and the order has never inverted in four years. The","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":88,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":88,"text":"absence of an inversion is the same observation at every margin, and the","end":"\n"}
